This folder contains the various functions used to transform and homogenize the bank entries from the various banks.
Here below the details of each file :

bp.py : functions for La Banque Postale
tsv_to_pdDf()

c24.py : functions for C24 Bank
csv_to_pdDf()

combine_bank_data.py : fucntions to combine and produce the output file used for the Excels Konto
merge_transactions()
write_to_csv()
